#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:4
msgid "Python 2 Sunset"
msgstr "Python 2 的落幕"

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:6
msgid ""
"Since January 2020 and the release of Setuptools 45, Python 2 is no longer "
"supported by the most current release (`discussion <https://github.com/pypa/"
"setuptools/issues/1458>`_). Setuptools as a project continues to support "
"Python 2 with bugfixes and important features on Setuptools 44.x."
msgstr ""
"自 2020 年 1 月發行 Setuptools 45 起，最新版本已不再支援 Python 2（`討論 "
"<https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/1458>`_）。Setuptools 專案將持續透"
"過 Setuptools 44.x 版本，為 Python 2 提供臭蟲修正與重要功能支援。"

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:12
msgid ""
"By design, most users will be unaffected by this change. That's because "
"Setuptools 45 declares its supported Python versions to exclude Python 2.7, "
"and installers such as pip 9 or later will honor this declaration and "
"prevent installation of Setuptools 45 or later in Python 2 environments."
msgstr ""
"就設計而言，大多數使用者不會受到此變更的影響。這是因為 Setuptools 45 宣告其支"
"援的 Python 版本不包含 Python 2.7，而 pip 9 或更新版本的安裝程式將會遵循此宣"
"告，並防止在 Python 2 環境中安裝 Setuptools 45 或更新版本。"

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:17
msgid ""
"Users that do import any portion of Setuptools 45 or later on Python 2 are "
"directed to this documentation to provide guidance on how to work around the "
"issues."
msgstr ""
"若使用者在 Python 2 上匯入 Setuptools 45 或更新版本的任何部分，將會被引導至此"
"文件，以提供如何解決這個議題的指引。"

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:22
msgid "Workarounds"
msgstr "權宜措施"

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:24
msgid ""
"The best recommendation is to avoid Python 2 and move to Python 3 where "
"possible. This project acknowledges that not all environments can drop "
"Python 2 support, so provides other options."
msgstr ""
"最佳建議是避免使用 Python 2 並盡可能遷移到 Python 3。本專案也意識到並非所有環"
"境都能放棄對 Python 2 的支援，因此提供了其他選項。"

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:28
msgid ""
"In less common scenarios, later versions of Setuptools can be installed on "
"unsupported Python versions. In these environments, the installer is advised "
"to first install ``setuptools<45`` to \"pin Setuptools\" to a compatible "
"version."
msgstr ""
"在極少數情況下，可能會在不支援的 Python 版本上安裝較高版本的 Setuptools。在這"
"種情況下，建議安裝程式首先安裝 ``setuptools<45`` 以「將 Setuptools 鎖定」到相"
"容的版本。"

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:33
msgid ""
"When using older versions of pip (before 9.0), the ``Requires-Python`` "
"directive is not honored and invalid versions can be installed. Users are "
"advised first to upgrade pip and retry or to pin Setuptools. Use ``pip --"
"version`` to determine the version of pip."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:37
msgid ""
"When using ``easy_install``, ``Requires-Python`` is not honored and later "
"versions can be installed. In this case, users are advised to pin "
"Setuptools. This applies to ``setup.py install`` invocations as well, as "
"they use Setuptools under the hood."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:43
msgid "It's still not working"
msgstr "仍然無法運作"

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:45
msgid ""
"If after trying the above steps, the Python environment still has "
"incompatible versions of Setuptools installed, here are some things to try."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:48
msgid ""
"Uninstall and reinstall Setuptools. Run ``pip uninstall -y setuptools`` for "
"the relevant environment. Repeat until there is no Setuptools installed. "
"Then ``pip install setuptools``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:51
msgid ""
"If possible, attempt to replicate the problem in a second environment "
"(virtual machine, friend's computer, etc). If the issue is isolated to just "
"one unique environment, first determine what is different about those "
"environments (or reinstall/reset the failing one to defaults)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:55
msgid ""
"End users who are not themselves the maintainers for the package they are "
"trying to install should contact the support channels for the relevant "
"application. Please be considerate of those projects by searching for "
"existing issues and following the latest guidance before reaching out for "
"support. When filing an issue, be sure to give as much detail as possible to "
"help the maintainers understand what factors led to the issue after "
"following their recommended guidance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:62
msgid ""
"Reach out to your local support groups. There's a good chance someone nearby "
"has the expertise and willingness to help."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../python 2 sunset.rst:64
msgid ""
"If all else fails, `file this template <https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/"
"issues/new?assignees=&labels=Python+2&template=setuptools-warns-about-"
"python-2-incompatibility."
"md&title=Incompatible+install+in+(summarize+your+environment)>`_ with "
"Setuptools. Please complete the whole template, providing as much detail "
"about what factors led to the issue. Setuptools maintainers will summarily "
"close tickets filed without any meaningful detail or engagement with the "
"issue."
msgstr ""
